% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% queries.clausal -- QUERY layer for eu/dora_register_of_information.
% A TOP-LAYER consumer: it imports the public predicates of the kernel and of
% the determination slice that it calls, and nothing else.
%
% dora_register_of_information_profile_keys/1      the forty-two profile keys, in contract order
% dora_register_of_information_input_problems/2    the INPUT CHECK (re-exported from the kernel)
% dora_register_of_information_what_if/4           (#16 what-if) one key overridden, status again
% dora_register_of_information_eligibility/2       (#2 eligibility, #7 justification) the decision
%                                                  with its cited checklist
% dora_register_of_information_compliance_check/3  (#13 compliance check) may the entity leave
%                                                  a duty unperformed in the current state
%
% The three called-contract queries (register_of_information_duties_required/3,
% register_of_information_duties_complete/3, register_of_information_duties_outstanding/3)
% live in the determination slice dora_register_of_information.clausal and are
% re-exported by the package facade.
%
% This module also exports the RESULT CONSTRUCTORS (data, declared with
% constructors/1 and given no clauses) and defines the ROOT ATOMS the called
% contract names (the forty-two profile keys, the thirty-four duty atoms, the
% judgement value unsure and the result atoms complete, incomplete and
% none_outstanding) as exported facts, so each is a package-root name. They
% are never called as queries and decide nothing.
%
% Every predicate here answers exactly once for each input: complementary
% clauses, cut-free, no negation as failure.
% =====================================================================

:- module(queries, [
    dora_register_of_information_profile_keys/1,
    dora_register_of_information_input_problems/2,
    dora_register_of_information_what_if/4,
    dora_register_of_information_eligibility/2,
    dora_register_of_information_compliance_check/3,
    complete/0,
    incomplete/0,
    none_outstanding/0,
    required/1,
